 status of 500 (Internal Server Error) <a href=\"https://andywon.shinyapps.io/sso-1/_w_c73154cd32e34e0e7e1d6b9ab8ec9a16d6d21b5b5b1abd20/shared/bootstrap/css/bootstrap.min.css\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://andywon.shinyapps.io/sso-1/_w_c73154cd32e34e0e7e1d6b9ab8ec9a16d6d21b5b5b1abd20/shared/bootstrap/css/bootstrap.min.css&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792364488732000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1Xy8Pn5O_QBog7rCrknONJ\">https://andywon.shinyapps.io/sso-1/_w_c73154cd32e34e0e7e1d6b9ab8ec9a16d6d21b5b5b1abd20/shared/bootstrap/css/bootstrap.min.css</a><br>Failed to load resource: the server responded with a status of 500 (Internal Server Error) <a href=\"https://andywon.shinyapps.io/sso-1/_w_c73154cd32e34e0e7e1d6b9ab8ec9a16d6d21b5b5b1abd20/shared/bootstrap/css/bootstrap-responsive.min.css\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://andywon.shinyapps.io/sso-1/_w_c73154cd32e34e0e7e1d6b9ab8ec9a16d6d21b5b5b1abd20/shared/bootstrap/css/bootstrap-responsive.min.css&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792364488732000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1BYU8qsU4Mz1RA8WCHwV68\">https://andywon.shinyapps.io/sso-1/_w_c73154cd32e34e0e7e1d6b9ab8ec9a16d6d21b5b5b1abd20/shared/bootstrap/css/bootstrap-responsive.min.css</a></blockquote><div><br></div><div>Here is my server.R code that loads the file:</div><div><br></div><div><div style=\"border:1px solid rgb(187,187,187);word-wrap:break-word;background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#000\">library</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">shiny</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>library</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">ggplot2</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>library</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">ggthemes</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><sp